	<id>logcleaner</id>
	<name>Log Cleaner</name>
	<summary>Administrator Tool for cleaning up the logfile</summary>
	<description><![CDATA[**Administration tool for cleaning up the log file**

- 🛡️ Only accessible for administration.
- 🎨 Error levels with different colors.
- ⚙️ Number of displayed log entries can be set.
- 🛠️ After correcting a log entry it can be deleted from the log file.
- ⏩ One click deletion of all duplicates within the log file.
- 🗑️ Empty the log file without using shell commands.
- 📜 View datails of log entries.
- 🔍 Find solutions on the internet by various search engines.]]></description>
